Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真能從論文找到線索嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那樣的人造心臟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,臨床也很困難吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,也許有植入失敗的事故
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,亞倫會提供非法試驗的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怪不得
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以找沒有戶籍Lycoris就辦了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一定能找到亞倫發掘研究者的線索
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,胡桃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,這是 色情 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,還是算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,LycoReco關店
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.34,0:02:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我占用大家的時間過意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,最後讓這家店留下美好的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你這樣甘心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,本來就這麼打算的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,都考慮好長時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.77,0:02:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 瑞希
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.30,0:02:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大家向瀧奈學習
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,回到自己的路上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 瑞希 你會去哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,去見相親網站認識的溫哥華帥哥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 給我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,肌肉男
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.41,0:02:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,胡桃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,沒了你們我在這國很危險
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟DA也在找你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我會出國
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:02:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那去德國吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.49,0:02:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,德國
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,又是桌遊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,對 桌遊聖地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,還有大規模展會
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那你也來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我幫你做護照
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,想法不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但老師會寂寞的還是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有機會邀請瀧奈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.53,0:03:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,從四月的武器交易起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.59,0:03:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,地鐵襲擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,謀殺Lycoris
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,襲擊警局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這一系列事件的主謀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是這個名為真島的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,在世界流竄的戰爭狂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,已確認十年前來過我國
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,參與了諸位所知的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,電視塔事件
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,本以為全員都被處刑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,她從小就是一等的制服
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真島接受了國內多個黑社會的委託
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:03:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,謀劃襲擊延空木
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我們抓獲了其中一個委託者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,判明了真島的潛伏地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,全力進攻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.75,0:04:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,找到並擊斃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,心臟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,大體上了解你們的關係了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可悲的誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是罪人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要是知道崇拜的吉叔是這種貨色想必很失望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真同情她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.99,0:04:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不過陰差陽錯讓我在電視塔撿了條命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以早就警告過你了亞倫機關
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我背叛了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,發展不如所願便插手是違反亞倫的規定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.81,0:04:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她偏離了路線是我的失誤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要負責
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那要殺了我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你是優秀的亞倫兒童
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:04:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,千支槍還不夠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,感激不盡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.22,0:05:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我和她一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,隨心所欲地活著
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以可能會隨心所欲地殺了你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能實現亞倫的理想
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.31,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,獻出生命在所不惜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,噁心的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你和DA一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,偷偷摸摸地企圖以正義之名控制世界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,DA下一個就是你們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,亞倫機關
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,總部在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,這回不用坐行李箱去機場了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 浪費了這可愛臉蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,承蒙照顧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.47,0:05:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 太見外了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:05:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞希也保重哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那千束拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,千束別太勉強
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大叔都那麼老了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那 請出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.28,0:06:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好 開始收拾吧老師
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,無可奈何
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.93,0:06:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟是千束所希望的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我什麼都沒說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,還有瀧奈在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真島的委託主嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不都招了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他的目標是延空木
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.59,0:06:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,提供武器的是你們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,又來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.13,0:06:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就算有槍沒有軍隊有什麼意義
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:06:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一千支呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那是吉松嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,吉松
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是Lycoris嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到伙伴都讓小孩殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我因為殺太多人被這裡開除了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.97,0:07:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,外頭也挺快活的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我不介意再被開除
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道吉松
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那槍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,亞倫 他說是亞倫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,亞倫機關嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道這些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是吉松
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼 宰了你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,延空木即將完工
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,將於明日舉行封頂典禮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,會場周圍的準備正有序進行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我正看著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不是要收拾嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是小麗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:07:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,之後怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.95,0:08:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,明早去找地產中介吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以做些兼職把店撐下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望如此嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你想待到什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.39,0:08:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,關門了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要好好和這裡道別啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要太勉強
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,老師都看出來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,確實好寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,喝杯咖啡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:08:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo無異常
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Delta無異常
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlie無異常
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這是讓他跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha無異常
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,來得不少啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.02,0:09:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,修學旅行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,放下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真島
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.82,0:09:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,帶隊老師也在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是指揮擊斃你的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真島
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看來不用自我介紹了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是Lycoris的頭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,目的是錢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,也包括
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟我們還需要生活費
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但此外還有讓我感興趣的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,興趣？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,去聯合黑社會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,想看看仗著正義的惡黨頭目是什麼嘴臉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.91,0:09:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,惡黨是你們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,現在判定善惡的基準是法律
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你們都是合法的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,法律誕生前我們一直都在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,超越政治體制
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,維持這個國家的治安和秩序
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.82,0:10:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,火速查明信號源
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.37,0:10:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,超越體制？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你算老幾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,別扯沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,結果還是保護了國家利益
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,馬基維利主義嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,陳腐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果把你們公之於眾社會將有什麼反響
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不用費心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真正和平的社會是連惡的存在都感覺不到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你也將不會留在任何人記憶裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,用你們擅長的消息封鎖嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.11,0:10:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不面對慘澹的現實
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,人們不會忘了和平的意義嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不是白給的而是爭取來的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,說得挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,惡黨不能接受自己是惡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我在擔心你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,善惡的天平
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,無論朝哪邊傾斜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,都輪不到你們插手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.37,0:11:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要找回平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是襲擊延空木的目的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,這都知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一個沒壞掉不平衡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就算有武器商人提供的槍結果也會和十年前一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這次她還會來救你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:31.17,Top,,0,0,0,,司令我們還沒鎖定信號源
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.71,Top,,0,0,0,,請爭取點時間
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,再見 Lycoris的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.21,0:11:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,別走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 黑髮Lyco
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.25,0:11:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你也回這邊了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,吉松在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你也找吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.87,0:11:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真是大紅人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我對你不感興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴我吉松在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我對你也不感興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,放輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了 到極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.05,0:11:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快掛掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那裡的咖啡應該還沒涼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:11:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,通信切斷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,找到最後的伺服器了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.09,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,最終訪問地點是大田區蒲田
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 有點…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,以後我該在哪畫漫畫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哪裡還有那麼安靜的店啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,總之絕對要回來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,約好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,這也太突然了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,別關店啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真假
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好累
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.19,0:12:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 好欣慰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,警備的Lycoris已就位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,延空木封頂典禮正式開始
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有請大沼都知事致辭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.23,0:13:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那個箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,多久沒開了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,來福槍？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,給你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,打開吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,鎖上門吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可能還有客人來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不是武器
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,和服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你的成人禮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不過離成年有點早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 很上相
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:13:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,問老師感想呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.64,0:14:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,當然很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,已經是端莊的女士了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.01,0:14:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝老師
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.57,0:14:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒做什麼值得感謝的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,給我起名的也是老師
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.53,0:14:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,教我槍的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,還有這家店
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.61,0:14:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,能和瀧奈邂逅也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,再說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,幫我找吉叔的也是老師吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才的照片發給吉叔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:30.51,Top,,0,0,0,,然後
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了老師
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼大聲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我們談談伸二的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,鎖定真島的車了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,避開典禮 向北方誘導
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,封鎖所有通往延空木的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,若是以破壞為目的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,必會來此處
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo就緒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlie就緒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Delta就緒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.41,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha就緒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,目標通過預測點
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,意味著逼上死路了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,包圍他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,之後拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我的駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,為了今天留的後門
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那時我拜託伸二做手術
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是為了指揮官的利益
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.43,0:15:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,至少當時是這麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.63,0:15:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,只要Lycoris在役期間活著就行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的話我就接手了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那和我約好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,約定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,把她培養成最強的殺手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.77,0:16:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.59,0:16:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,吉叔不是說自己是救死扶傷的救世主
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.60,0:16:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,說不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在你心中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,對伸二的越來越憧憬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,變成支撐你對抗死神的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那既耀眼 又飄渺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,早說就好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你的人生錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果繼續殺戮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伸二還會來救你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,早說就好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:16:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴我千束
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你 老師
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,感謝你讓我做決定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你告訴我了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我估計會認命了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,然後無奈繼續Lycoris的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,然後把所有的不愉快全都怪罪老師和吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那不好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,和開店都是我的決定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然後對老師和吉叔的感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,聽了這番話也不會改變
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,二位都是我的父親
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那是最幸福的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 老師別哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.49,0:17:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,老師怎麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.55,0:18:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,這個千束如何
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,喜歡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.97,0:18:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我自豪的女兒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,現在延空木封頂典禮的最後
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.53,0:18:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,發射電視信號
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,倒數計時後
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.44,0:18:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,延空木的系統將自動發射信號
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,各位一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.56,0:18:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.05,0:18:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.47,0:18:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你們好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,愚民們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我通過延空木告訴你們點真相
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:46.86,Top,,0,0,0,,來自延空木的信號
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:47.56,Top,,0,0,0,,切斷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:48.94,Top,,0,0,0,,Radiata著手處理
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.94,0:18:51.98,Top,,800,0,0,,切斷侵入信號需耗時約90秒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.18,0:18:51.56,Top,,0,800,0,,真島有何企圖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他國正苦於恐襲和戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.07,0:18:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,只有這裡一片祥和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,真噁心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.21,0:19:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,因為高尚的素質嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,因為日本人很厲害嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,無能的人總是以自己的標籤自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,恐襲都發生多少次了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,只不過被隱瞞了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,滿是虛偽和誇張的和平宣傳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,汙點全被遮蓋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,這個國家有群人執著於這種寒酸的和平
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我把這個東西放到了都內各處
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,千支槍就是為此嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不要管持槍的普通市民
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對不要開火
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他真正的目的是戳破Lycoris的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.41,0:19:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.65,0:19:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,放下槍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:19:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.51,0:20:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,來隨便開槍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.75,0:20:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,然後自衛反擊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.59,0:20:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,想幹什麼隨你們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,讓沒有虛偽的真實世界…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,切斷延空木的信號了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,司令 總部來聯絡了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.15,0:20:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Radiata足以進行消息管制
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.67,0:20:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lycoris的存在一定不會暴露
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,然而你們從存在已經向全日本暗示了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這是重大失誤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,為何不用錦木千束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.56,0:20:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不是為此才養了她嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.16,0:20:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,作戰計劃請讓我們籌劃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木 你在蔑視我們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我再說一次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.80,0:20:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,讓錦木千束上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒有選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:20:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,現在宣布首都戒嚴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,重複一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,延空木被恐怖分子占領
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:04.76,Top,,0,0,0,,劫持了信號發射系統
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,罪犯年齡30餘歲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.21,0:21:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,讓千束接電話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,千束現在正忙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,老師讓我接
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.73,0:21:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我是千束
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,馬上來本部
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,和我們會合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.77,0:21:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,去擊斃延空木的真島
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你接近延空木他就沒命了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一小時後起爆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,現狀需要你的支援
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,關係到眾多人的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.85,0:21:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你這樣的Lycoris來了就麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,關係到他的性命哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.63,0:21:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.65,0:21:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,沒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.69,0:21:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,待會回電話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.18,0:21:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,別耍小聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在看你們
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,陷阱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但也不能見死不救
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我剛才說了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,伸二
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.73,0:22:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是懷疑老師
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.83,0:22:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想當面問吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,武器庫的彈藥看樣能處理掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,儘管拿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.66,0:22:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.89,0:22:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,延空沒有瀧奈和蜂斗在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.47,0:22:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她們和你一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.35,0:22:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我優秀的學生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.55,0:22:47.47,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}君が持ってきた漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:50.47,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}くれた知らない名前のお花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.76,0:22:53.10,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今日はまだ来ないかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:56.48,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}初めての感情知ってしまった
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.94,0:23:02.40,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}窓に飾った絵画をなぞってひとりで宇宙を旅して
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.52,0:23:07.74,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}それだけでいいはずだったのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.74,0:23:14.08,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君の手を握ってしまったら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.41,0:23:20.29,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}孤独を知らないこの街には
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:31.05,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}もう二度と帰ってくることはできないのでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:42.44,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君が手を差し伸べた　光で影が生まれる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.56,0:23:48.28,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}歌って聞かせてこの話の続き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:57.29,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}連れて行って見たことない星まで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.55,0:22:47.47,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}你送我的漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:50.47,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}和不知名的花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.76,0:22:53.10,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今天還沒來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:56.48,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}這種感情初次體驗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.94,0:23:02.40,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在窗上臨摹塗鴉  獨自前往星辰大海
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.52,0:23:07.74,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}我本該心滿意足
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.74,0:23:14.08,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}直到握住你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.41,0:23:20.29,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在這不懂孤獨的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:31.05,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}已經再也回不到從前了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:42.44,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}你伸出了手  光影伴生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.56,0:23:48.28,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}聽我歌唱 聽我訴說
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:57.29,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}帶我去未知的星球
